# AGENTS.md

Notes for coding agents working on Shelf.

## Commands

- `npm start` runs the app on port 3000.
- `npm test` runs the tests.

## How we work

Each task goes plan → build → review, as `docs/agents/development-cycle.md` says. The sprint under way is in `docs/sprints/`, and our decisions are in `docs/decisions/`.

SHF-3 is under way: shelves the reader names, as D2 decided.

## Rules

- Keep the code in `src/`, as ES modules.
- Add no dependency without asking.
- Git is read-only by default. Ask the owner for approval before each branch, checkout, commit, push or merge.
